# MixAuto media session, album art, audio source

## Agent front matter

**Owners:** `MediaPlayerPane.kt`, `AlbumArtDisplay.kt`, `data/media/MediaSessionRepository.kt`, `data/media/MediaSessionParsers.kt`, `MixAutoNotificationListenerService.kt`, `ui/components/AudioSettingsPanel.kt`.

**Common tasks:** now-playing UI, default audio source, boot/resume (`ensureDefaultPlayerIfNeeded`, `attemptResumeNow`), album art modes/gestures, idle manual-play fallbacks.

**Anti-patterns:** `BackgroundAudioLauncher.launchFallbackResumeLink()` for manual user taps (refocuses Mix Auto); stale closures in `pointerInput` without `rememberUpdatedState`; second GPS subscription for media.

## Media session / now playing

- Media controls in `MediaPlayerPane.kt`: each button in `Row` needs `Modifier.weight(1f)` + `requiredSize(MinTapTarget)` or last button shrinks when pane is narrow
- Now playing: `MediaSessionRepository` + `MixAutoNotificationListenerService`; user must enable Notification access — `MediaSessionManager.getActiveSessions()` requires enabled listener component
- `MainActivity.onResume()` calls `MediaSessionRepository.refreshSessions()` after returning from notification-access settings or media apps
- Media auto-play on boot: `MediaSessionRepository.maybeAutoPlay()` once per process (`hasAutoPlayed`) when session has metadata but is not `STATE_PLAYING`; call from `attachController()` **and** retry in `onMetadataChanged()` (late metadata on head unit boot) and same-token re-attach branch; requires notification access enabled; **`ensureDefaultPlayerIfNeeded()`** in `MainActivity.refreshMediaSessionsAndBootAudio()` wakes `LauncherPreferences.defaultAudioPackage` once per process via `BackgroundAudioLauncher.wakeWithForegroundFallback()` (MediaBrowser bind + play, not `launchAppByPackage`; fallback launch+refocus Mix Auto), then retries `refreshSessions()` at 2s/5s/10s; user taps still use `launchAppByPackage()`; register `OnActiveSessionsChangedListener` on first successful refresh
- Default audio source: `LauncherPreferences.defaultAudioPackage` (key `default_audio_package`, empty = unset) → `LauncherViewModel.updateDefaultAudioPackage()`; clear on init if `canLaunchApp()` fails; no default + no session → inline `AudioPlayerListContent` in `MediaPlayerPane` ("Choose the default audio source", tap sets default + launches); default set + idle → normal player + boot launch fallback; active session always wins in `selectController()`
- **Idle manual-play fallbacks** (`MediaPlayerPane.kt`, `!hasActiveSession`): priority (1) `audioFallbackResumeLink` set → empty art surface + tappable **Play the album manually** (opens link via `ACTION_VIEW`, optionally `setPackage(defaultAudioPackage)` when resolvable — **no** Mix Auto refocus; do NOT use `BackgroundAudioLauncher.launchFallbackResumeLink` for manual taps); (2) no link but default set → default app icon in art slot + subtitle **Start music on the player manually** (`launchAppByPackage`); (3) neither → legacy **No track playing** / **Album Art** placeholder; long-press album art still opens mode picker on idle surfaces
- **Audio Settings drawer:** `ActivePanel.AUDIO_SETTINGS` — overflow ⋮ in `MediaPlayerPane` header; `AudioSettingsPanelContent` in `ui/components/AudioSettingsPanel.kt` (default source list, fallback resume link field, resume-on-startup toggle, show-album-art-controls toggle); 60% pane / 40% map split; map tap dismiss; `DisposableEffect` on dismiss calls `MediaSessionRepository.attemptResumeNow()` with current prefs
- **Audio resume prefs:** `LauncherPreferences.audioFallbackResumeLink` (URL/deep link), `showAlbumArtControls` (default **false**), `resumeAudioOnStartup` (default **true**); boot path = `ensureDefaultPlayerIfNeeded()` once per process; manual path = `attemptResumeNow()` (shorter delays: 1.5s/3.5s refresh, 5s fallback); no default + fallback set → launch link immediately; fallback via `BackgroundAudioLauncher.launchFallbackResumeLink()` — plain web share URLs may not autoplay in target app
- Audio player picker: shared `AudioPlayerListContent` in `AudioPlayerPickerOverlay.kt` — overlay tap launches app only; long-press → confirm dialog → set default; row suffix `(Default)`; overlay bottom hint **Long press to set as default** (`showLongPressHint` false in setup mode); `SetDefaultAudioConfirmDialog` is `internal` for reuse in Audio Settings
- Default source / picker entry points: ⋮ or source icon (no session) → `ActivePanel.AUDIO_SETTINGS` — NOT inline `showAudioPicker` overlay in `MediaPlayerPane`
- Source app icon helpers: `ui/components/AppIconUtils.kt` — `rememberAppIcon()`, `canLaunchApp()`, `launchAppByPackage()`; drawable→bitmap via private `Drawable.toImageBitmap()` (no Accompanist)
- `MediaSessionRepository.setPreferredAudioSource(packageName)`: in-memory `preferredPackage`; `selectController()` attaches preferred only — returns null (idle UI) when preferred has no session, does not fall back to another playing app
- `loadAudioPlayerPackageNames()` in `AudioPlayerUtils.kt` — used by `loadAudioPlayerApps()` for Audio Settings / `AudioPlayerPickerOverlay` only; do **not** use it to special-case dock or app-drawer taps
- Transport controls row order: `[Source app] [Prev] [Play/Pause] [Next] [Like]` — gated by `LauncherViewModel.showAlbumArtControls` (default off); first slot is `SourceAppButton`: **tap** = launch `sourcePackage` when session active, else open Audio Settings (shows default app icon when default set, cyan `MusicNote` when not); **long-press** opens Audio Settings; Like is 5th button with `active = mediaState.isLiked == true`
- When transport row hidden: Info (ⓘ) button beside ⋮ opens `GestureHintDialog` (gestures + pointer to re-enable buttons in Audio Settings)
- Media like: `MediaSessionRepository.toggleLike()` via `RATING_HEART` / custom actions; never send dislike/thumb_down (YT Music skips on unlike); `likedTrackCache` keyed by media ID
- Media shuffle (repo only): `MediaSessionRepository.toggleShuffle()` + `MediaSessionParsers.readShuffleState()` — YT Music returns `SHUFFLE_MODE_INVALID`; use `ACTION_SET_SHUFFLE_MODE` actions-bit for `supportsShuffle` and `cachedShuffleOn` when toggling if mode stays invalid; third-party shuffle UI removed as unreliable

## Album art

- Album art gestures in `MediaPlayerPane.kt`: double-tap play/pause; swipe L/R prev/next; swipe up like; long-press opens `AlbumArtModePicker` — disable normal `pointerInput` while `isPickerOpen`; swipe down does nothing (shuffle removed); **`pointerInput` keys:** `(hasActiveSession, supportsLike, swipeThresholdPx)` only — callbacks and `albumArtMode` must use `rememberUpdatedState` (stale `albumArtMode` in long-press was a real bug); dual coroutine tap detector + drag loop share one `pointerInput`, consumption only after 40dp swipe threshold
- Album art modes in `AlbumArtDisplay.kt`: `PLAIN`, `VINYL` (spinning record), `VISUALIZER` (animated bars); `AlbumArtModeContent()` helper; picker tap or second long-press confirms selection; **`AlbumArtMode.VISUALIZER` choice persisted** via `LauncherPreferences.albumArtMode` / `LauncherViewModel.updateAlbumArtMode()` — do NOT store in `remember` inside `MediaPlayerPane`
- Spectrum visualizer (`AnimatedSpectrumVisualizer` in `AlbumArtDisplay.kt`): shared animation by album-art **VISUALIZER** and **`DockMiniVisualizer`**; **album** = thin bars (`VisualizerBarLayout.THIN`, 24 bars, 42% slot width); **dock icon** = thick bars (`VisualizerBarLayout.DOCK`, 6 bars, legacy left-cluster width formula); **horizontal collapsed title strip** = `DockMiniVisualizer(wide = true, barCount = 32)` → `VisualizerBarLayout.DOCK_WIDE` (even slots across full 280dp); do NOT use DOCK_WIDE/slot formula on icon-sized dock visualizers — thins bars; bottom-aligned; bass→treble band blend + frame smoothing; beat-ish motion from `playbackPositionMs`
- Visualizer not reacting to real bass/treble: MediaSession provides `playbackPositionMs` only — no FFT/Visualizer API for YT Music on AOSP; motion is position-anchored simulation, not audio analysis
- Vinyl circular clip: apply `clip(CircleShape)` then `graphicsLayer { rotationZ }` on the Box — do not use `Modifier.rotate` before clip (produces rectangular artifact)
- Album art sizing: `BoxWithConstraints` → `(if (maxWidth < maxHeight) maxWidth else maxHeight) * 0.92f` — do not use `kotlin.math.min` on Dp values
